OL,3,GNEWSA'No plans' to extend Guernsey tax 
OL,4,Areturn deadline                        
OL,6,FThe Revenue Service said it had no     
OL,7,Fplans to extend the deadline for 2025  
OL,8,Ftax returns, despite receiving just    
OL,9,Fover half the expected personal tax    
OL,10,Freturns two weeks before the deadline. 
OL,12,FThe deadline for 2025 tax returns is 30
OL,13,FNovember 2026. The 2024 deadline was   
OL,14,Fchanged from 30 November 2025 to 31    
OL,15,FJanuary 2026 after IT system issues.   
OL,17,FThe States said although islanders were
OL,18,Fwaiting for assessments or repayments  
OL,19,Ffrom previous years, the Revenue       
OL,20,FService still has a statutory          
OL,21,Fresponsibility to collect them.        
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
