OL,3,GNEWSA'No plans' to extend Guernsey tax 
OL,4,Areturn deadline                        
OL,6,FJean Mehers, director of the Revenue   
OL,7,FService, said "We would encourage      
OL,8,Fpeople to file their tax returns early 
OL,9,Fbut we do find that a lot of people    
OL,10,Fleave it to near the deadline."        
